@{61265f34b62ac7596b17966a|full_name}

> You may have some trouble with the font that you’ve picked there. You may want to increase the weight of the font as at a distance, as it may start to flicker.

The weights are identical to VRChat, the only change made was to the size of the username and the size of the avatar, shrinking them both very slightly to better suit the nameplate and refine the visual identity :)

@{62770b2ab9aa4552a0459dc1|full_name}

That’s fair enough, I’d still say it’s a good idea to test it at a distance and see whether the username remains readable, particularly at the lower resolution that the game operates at on platforms like the Quest. 

I’d say experiment with it and see if it looks off with a larger weight, if it doesn’t look off, then there’s inherently no reason for it to not have a larger weight considering it’s the primary focus on the nameplate.
